# Input

```css
.case-slash-values-css { font:16px/1.5 serif; grid-row:1 / 3; border-radius:10px / 20px; }
.case-grid-identifiers-css { grid-template-columns:[start sidebar-start] 1fr [sidebar-end content-start] 2fr [content-end]; grid-template-rows:[top] auto [bottom]; }

```


# Formatted

```css
.case-slash-values-css {
	font: 16px / 1.5 serif;
	grid-row: 1 / 3;
	border-radius: 10px / 20px;
}
.case-grid-identifiers-css {
	grid-template-columns: [start sidebar-start] 1fr [sidebar-end content-start] 2fr [content-end];
	grid-template-rows: [top] auto [bottom];
}

```

# Lines exceeding max width of 80 characters
```
    7: 	grid-template-columns: [start sidebar-start] 1fr [sidebar-end content-start] 2fr [content-end];
```
